# Joint family discriminator, ported from upstream b2JointType in types.h.
# Values match upstream so solver dispatch and serialisation stay aligned.
Enum JointType
## Rigid or springy rope constraint between two anchor points.
DistanceJoint
## Collision filter override between two bodies; has no solver behaviour.
FilterJoint
## Soft constraint pulling body B to an offset pose relative to body A.
MotorJoint
## Soft constraint dragging a body anchor toward a world target.
MouseJoint
## Translation along a body-A axis with optional spring, limits, and motor.
PrismaticJoint
## Rotation about a shared anchor with optional spring, limits, and motor.
RevoluteJoint
## Rigid or soft relative-pose lock between two bodies.
WeldJoint
## Wheel: translation along a body-A axis plus rotation about the anchor.
WheelJoint
End Enum
